<section class="fpg-fo-sec" id="features"><div class="fpg-fo-wrap"><h2 class="fpg-fo-h2">How the TT6 is built</h2><ul class="fpg-fo-feats" role="list">
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>FörstGrip feed rollers</h3><p>Twin hydraulic rollers. The top one lifts on an arc and is held down by two heavy springs, so it climbs over butt ends and drags in forks and awkward limbs.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Open-top flywheel</h3><p>A 640 × 25 mm flywheel with twin 8-inch blades throws the chip instead of blowing it, so wet, green material is far less likely to block the chute.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>AutoIntelligence control</h3><p>Sealed electronics that run the no-stress feed, tell you when a service is due and prompt the routine checks. Proof against water and vibration.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Easy-access anvil</h3><p>The anvil turns or swaps in minutes, so a fresh edge is never a workshop job.</p></div></li>
</ul></div></section>
